16	  // live neighbours and survives. Neither reading reproduces the Gen 1 it depicts.
17	  // This test therefore covers survival with an unambiguous case derived from the
18	  // four rules: in a vertical blinker the centre cell has exactly 2 live neighbours.
19	  it("keeps a live cell with 2 neighbors alive (survival) — center (0,1) of [(0,0), (0,1), (0,2)] survives", () => {
20	    expect(nextGeneration([[0, 0], [0, 1], [0, 2]])).toContainEqual([0, 1]);
21	  });
22	  // NOTE: the spec's Rule 3 prose says the centre has 4 live neighbours, but the
